(meta (title "Pancakes, thin"))

@read-list{
- 2.5 dl flour
- 6 dl milk
- 3 eggs
- 0.5 tsp salt
- butter, for the pan
}

Whisk the flour with half of the milk until it is smooth, then add the rest
of the milk, the eggs and the salt. Let it rest for half an hour. Fry them
thin in butter, and serve them with jam.
